{"channelId":"UCHp1Tntd8AJ1LW4QxvFBo8Q","row":["Harmony Farm Sanctuary",244,"Harmony Farm Sanctuary (HFS) is a nonprofit vegan farm sanctuary in beautiful Central Oregon. Our mission is two-fold; first, we rescue, rehabilitate and provide an excellent home for retired, unwanted or abused farmed animals. Second, we strive to build compassion for all sentient beings.\n\nCurrently, Harmony Farm Sanctuary is home to more than 130 rescued farm animals! They depend 100% on donors like you for all of their care.\n\n501(c)3 Not-for-Profit for Farm Animal Rescue\nFederal ID# 47-4073127.","",""],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCHp1Tntd8AJ1LW4QxvFBo8Q","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCHp1Tntd8AJ1LW4QxvFBo8Q","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:10:47.113Z","channelId":"UCHp1Tntd8AJ1LW4QxvFBo8Q","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"f169d15f52fcbbd25953703bcc16da8f142179489d9b35bedbf734dce8a1271a","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"4ab39e315cb6e998684148cf386501dbb1991198cf2d122d28896ef687298eb8"},"countrySource":{},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCHp1Tntd8AJ1LW4QxvFBo8Q","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":244,"raw":"244 subscribers","precision":"exact","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCHp1Tntd8AJ1LW4QxvFBo8Q","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:10:47.113Z"}],"emails":[],"contactPages":[],"matchedKeywords":["animal rescue"],"relevantKeywords":["animal rescue"],"priorityKeywords":[],"quality":[{"keyword":"animal rescue","relevant":false,"evidenceLevel":"unconfirmed","role":"undetermined","flags":[],"sourceUrls":[]}],"cleanup":{"status":"keep","code":"biography_audience_admitted","reason":"完整主频道简介与保存的采集原文一致，命中本人／团队／服务语境；职业资质仍未核验。","keywords":["animal rescue"],"role":"organization_self_report","excerpt":"nimals! They depend 100% on donors like you for all of their care.\n\n501(c)3 Not-for-Profit for Farm Animal Rescue\nFederal ID# 47-4073127.","sourceUrl":"https: